# #4080 — werk's served hasDesignDoc pointed at werk-subproduct-design, a 920-byte
# pointer stub retired 2026-07-12 (#3421). The real design is werk-product-design.html
# (Kade). Authored here so the product row can point at the doc Jeff actually reads;
# the stub row stays (prod carries it) until retired.
chorus:document-werk-product-design a chorus:Document ;
    chorus:docState """current""" ;
    chorus:docTitle """Werk — Product Design""" ;
    chorus:docHref """/designing/docs/werk-product-design.html""" ;
    chorus:comment """Werk as a Product (Jeff, 2026-07-12, #3421): why pay not just prompt, the 12-verb family, the four domains, card-artifact coherence, the query-backwards model. Consolidates ten former werk docs.""" ;
    rdfs:comment """Werk as a Product (Jeff, 2026-07-12, #3421): why pay not just prompt, the 12-verb family, the four domains, card-artifact coherence, the query-backwards model. Consolidates ten former werk docs.""" ;
    chorus:hasDomain chorus:pipelines ;
